    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90127" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προστᾰτ-ήριος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>standing before</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῖμα π.
				καρδίας</span> fear <i>hovering before</i>, or <i>lording
				it over</i>, my heart, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				976
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>standing before, protecting</i>, of Artemis, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Th.</u>
				449
			</span></i>; of Apollo as the tutelary god or (acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>) from his statue <i>standing before</i> the doors, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				637
			</span></i>, Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.674.6
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. θεοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>CIG</u>
					3530
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Cyme</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ Π</span>. (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήν</span>), a Boeot, month, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.655e
			</span></i>.</div>
